  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As the number of electrons are increased it increases the radius of the element.&nbsp; As the number of protons are increased the radius is decreased.</p><p>As we can see:</p><p>Radius of :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Eu</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>199</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pm</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>Ce</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>183</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pm</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>Ho</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>176</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pm</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>170</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pm</mi></math></p>",
